- Launch Streamlit dashboard (`streamlit run dashboard/app.py`).
- Upload a test satellite image and verify single-pass segmentation without errors.
- Click **Fetch & Analyze Scene** and verify live satellite markers appear accurately on the Leaflet/Folium satellite globe.
